id: combat-tactician
name: Combat Tactician
talentCategory: condition
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  You have learned to take advantage of your weakened opponents.
text: >
  Combat Tactician: You have learned to take advantage of your weakened opponents.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Combat Rolls by 1(T) against any Opponent(s) that are suffering from a Combat Condition.

---

[passive]
# (1) Your Strike against them, your Dodge or Parry against their attack, your Wound against them - an Opponent suffering from
# a Combat Condition, Heart of Courage's aside (chat.mjs tacticianParts).
combatRolls.vsConditioned += 1(T);
